    {
      "id": "claim_38f8102d84a14538a3eb6f078d267f32",
      "statement": "In the feature extraction pipeline, `build_taxon_index_map` projects external iNaturalist taxon IDs into dense zero-indexed class indices, and `create_stratified_embedding_split` partitions representations into four stratified splits (train, validation, calibration, test) saved as discrete PyTorch tensor files while computing empirical per-class sample frequencies for Class-Balanced Loss weighting.",
